  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2026-04-15T16:46:47.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "### Movie Spoiler Checker\r\n\r\nThis app displays a dynamic warning badge to advise you whether it is safe to share a movie-related post with a specific friend.\r\n\r\nIt bases it decision on two conditions:\r\n\r\n1. `finishedMovie`: Have both you and your friend already watched the movie to the end?\r\n2. `hasSpoilerTags`: Does the post itself contain potential spoilers??\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Click through the different combinations of \"Yes\" and \"No\" in the app.\r\n\r\n2. In your [Nested Conditionals Activity Guide](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MBVchKlQvfBe9Ob3wpiyhog1sjZHmup_wcrIqH7HtEQ/edit?usp=sharing), describe the outcome of each combination of \"Yes\" or \"No\" and check that the code works as expected.\r\n\r\n3. Prompt AI to help you understand the nested `if/else` statements.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
